*> vybe-test: cobol/qualified_names_of_clause/qualified_field_display_then_move_back
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_qualified_names_of_clause.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 SOURCE.
   05 ID PIC 9(4) VALUE 9999.
01 TARGET.
   05 ID PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY ID OF SOURCE.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING ID DELIMITED SIZE OF DELIMITED SIZE SOURCE DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "9999"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [9999] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    MOVE ID OF SOURCE TO ID OF TARGET.
    DISPLAY ID OF TARGET.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING ID DELIMITED SIZE OF DELIMITED SIZE TARGET DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "9999"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [9999] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

